// g7250_main_spi6_ch394.repl — functional CH394 Ethernet on SPI6.
//
// The clean-room CH394 model (models/csharp/G7250Slaves.cs `G7250Ch394`,
// compiled in first via `i @...`) as an SPI6 slave, with its chip-select wired:
// CS# is GPIOG pin 15 (PG15, idles high, asserted low per transaction), so the
// model frames W5500 register transfers on the CS# edge (Renode fires
// FinishTransmission per byte, which cannot delimit a frame). The model logs the
// source IP when the firmware programs SIPR — the chip-side A1.12 confirmation
// (forced default 192.168.3.199). Load AFTER g7250_main.repl AND the `i` include.
ch394: Antmicro.Renode.Peripherals.SPI.G7250Ch394 @ spi6

gpioPortG:
    15 -> ch394@0
